---

<DocsLayout title="Tables">
  <p>MarkRust supports GitHub Flavored Markdown pipe tables. In Rich mode, cells are editable. Tab / Shift-Tab move between cells (Tab on the last cell inserts a row). A table toolbar appears while the caret is in a table: insert or delete rows and columns. Right-click a cell to focus it (the toolbar follows). The first row stays the header; the last remaining row and column cannot be deleted.</p>

  <CodeBlock code={`| Column A | Column B |\n|----------|----------|\n| Cell 1   | Cell 2   |`} lang="markdown" />

  <h2>Alignment</h2>
  <p>Use colons in the delimiter row for alignment:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>:---</code> left (default)</li>
    <li><code>:---:</code> center</li>
    <li><code>---:</code> right</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Rendering</h2>
  <p>Header rows render bold. Source mode pads columns until the table is focused, then shows raw pipes.</p>
</DocsLayout>
